WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.120 align:start position:19%
In 1876 in Kentucky, something
impossible happened. Chunks of fresh

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:11.880 align:start position:19%
meat fell from a clear blue sky.
Witnesses said the pieces rained down

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:15.840 align:start position:19%
for several minutes, splattering across
a farm field. Scientists examined the

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:20.800 align:start position:19%
meat and they believed it was lung
tissue. But how did it get into the sky?

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:26.280 align:start position:19%
The leading theory is wild. A flock of
vultures flying high above vomited their

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:33.240 align:start position:19%
meal all at once. A sky full of vultures
raining meat. Nature is truly bizarre.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.240 align:start position:19%
